# @agents-index Every non-secret variable that loupe-public reads, with no value; copy to .env.public and fill in.
# This file must hold no secret. The role public stops at start when a secret is set.
# Copy the values of LOUPE_TZ, LOUPE_SITE_TITLE, and each LOUPE_SUBSCRIPTION_ line from .env,
# so the public page and the page on 8787 show the same days, title, and subscription cost.
# compose.yaml sets LOUPE_ENV and LOUPE_ROLE; do not set them here.
# IANA time zone that cuts the days. Default UTC.
# LOUPE_TZ=
# LOUPE_SITE_TITLE=
# One line per subscription, the same lines as in .env, for example LOUPE_SUBSCRIPTION_CLAUDE_MAX=200.
# LOUPE_SUBSCRIPTION_CLAUDE_MAX=
# The live feed. A front proxy that changes the Host header needs LOUPE_LIVE_ALLOWED_ORIGIN.
# LOUPE_LIVE_ENABLED=
# LOUPE_LIVE_ALLOWED_ORIGIN=
# LOUPE_LIVE_MAX_RATE=
# LOUPE_LIVE_MAX_CONNECTIONS=
# LOUPE_LIVE_BUFFER=
# The telemetry setting: the value 1 stops the start request of a release build.
# DO_NOT_TRACK=
